1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,625
Conference Centre Reservations.

2
00:00:01,625 --> 00:00:02,560
Good morning.

3
00:00:02,560 --> 00:00:02,610
Hi.

4
00:00:02,610 --> 00:00:07,200
I'm interested in the computing conference next month.

5
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:09,210
Future Directions in Computing?

6
00:00:09,210 --> 00:00:09,588
Yes,

7
00:00:09,588 --> 00:00:10,343
that's right.

8
00:00:10,343 --> 00:00:13,740
Could I ask you a few questions about it?

9
00:00:13,740 --> 00:00:14,890
Of course.

10
00:00:14,890 --> 00:00:15,270
OK.

11
00:00:15,270 --> 00:00:21,724
I know the conference is for three days but actually I want to attend on the Friday

12
00:00:21,724 --> 00:00:22,863
and Saturday only.

13
00:00:22,863 --> 00:00:25,900
Will that work out to be any cheaper?

14
00:00:25,900 --> 00:00:27,850
Let me have a look.

15
00:00:27,850 --> 00:00:31,360
Well, you could register for the two days separately,

16
00:00:31,360 --> 00:00:36,820
but that wouldn't actually save you very much as it still costs ￡35 for

17
00:00:36,820 --> 00:00:37,600
each day.

18
00:00:37,600 --> 00:00:42,229
In fact,if you could register for the three days, you also get an invitation

19
00:00:42,229 --> 00:00:44,698
to a free dinner on the Saturday night,

20
00:00:44,698 --> 00:00:46,550
so that's probably the better option.

21
00:00:46,550 --> 00:00:48,095
Right, I'll do that.

22
00:00:48,095 --> 00:00:51,570
How much will the fees be in that case?

23
00:00:51,570 --> 00:00:53,600
It's ￡75.

24
00:00:53,600 --> 00:00:54,369
All right.

25
00:00:54,369 --> 00:00:57,832
I'd like to register for the full three days.

26
00:00:57,832 --> 00:01:00,910
Now, can I pay that by credit card?

27
00:01:00,910 --> 00:01:01,764
I'm afraid not.

28
00:01:01,764 --> 00:01:04,042
You'll have to send a cheque to us,

29
00:01:04,042 --> 00:01:06,320
or you can pay at the conference office.

30
00:01:06,320 --> 00:01:06,775
Fine.

31
00:01:06,775 --> 00:01:10,875
So it's probably easiest if I pay by cheque.

32
00:01:10,875 --> 00:01:14,974
Now then, what else do I need to arrange?

33
00:01:14,974 --> 00:01:15,430
Right.

34
00:01:15,430 --> 00:01:16,796
How about accommodation?

35
00:01:16,796 --> 00:01:20,440
I guess that's not included in the price?

36
00:01:20,440 --> 00:01:21,874
No, I'm sorry, it's not,

37
00:01:21,874 --> 00:01:25,890
but we do have a few rooms available for delegates at the conference centre

38
00:01:25,890 --> 00:01:26,750
if you'd like.

39
00:01:26,750 --> 00:01:30,563
Those are very cheap but if you're interested you'll need to book soon,

40
00:01:30,563 --> 00:01:32,910
because there's always a heavy demand for them.

41
00:01:32,910 --> 00:01:34,966
They are only ￡15 per night,

42
00:01:34,966 --> 00:01:39,421
but they are very basic and you'd have to get your own breakfast,

43
00:01:39,421 --> 00:01:41,820
because they don't provide you with that.

44
00:01:41,820 --> 00:01:43,191
But it's very convenient,

45
00:01:43,191 --> 00:01:46,620
because it's in the same building as the conference rooms.

46
00:01:46,620 --> 00:01:47,440
Uhuh.

47
00:01:47,440 --> 00:01:51,697
Or there's a very reasonable guest house which is ￡25 per night.

48
00:01:51,697 --> 00:01:54,180
And I think that includes your breakfast.

49
00:01:54,180 --> 00:01:56,680
Is it close to the conference centre?

50
00:01:56,680 --> 00:02:00,400
It would be about a ten-minute walk away from here.

51
00:02:00,400 --> 00:02:01,563
I see.

52
00:02:01,563 --> 00:02:03,890
That sounds quite reasonable.

53
00:02:03,890 --> 00:02:06,497
The details are all in our conference pack,

54
00:02:06,497 --> 00:02:07,800
which I'll send you.

55
00:02:07,800 --> 00:02:08,686
Great, thanks.

56
00:02:08,686 --> 00:02:10,459
That'll be very useful.

57
00:02:10,459 --> 00:02:10,902
Oh,

58
00:02:10,902 --> 00:02:14,890
and can you also send me an application form?

59
00:02:14,890 --> 00:02:15,496
Of course.

60
00:02:15,496 --> 00:02:18,528
I'll get that in the post to you straight away.

61
00:02:18,528 --> 00:02:19,740
Is there anything else?

62
00:02:19,740 --> 00:02:20,732
Yes, actually.

63
00:02:20,732 --> 00:02:25,690
Can you tell me where exactly the conference centre is?

64
00:02:25,690 --> 00:02:29,477
Well, it's on South Park Road and it's right at the end of the

65
00:02:29,477 --> 00:02:30,830
road next to the library.

66
00:02:30,830 --> 00:02:35,630
It's a ten-minute taxi ride from the station and will cost you ￡5.

67
00:02:35,630 --> 00:02:40,396
Otherwise, you can take the bus which runs every half an hour from the

68
00:02:40,396 --> 00:02:44,140
station-that's the 21A-and it brings you straight to the conference centre.

69
00:02:44,140 --> 00:02:45,900
Right, got that.
